{"seq":3,"slug":"caching-deduplication","title":"缓存与去重策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-cost-token-optimization/optimization/caching-deduplication","wordCount":1534,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"缓存与去重策略\">缓存与去重策略</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>缓存以存储换推理——存储成本比推理成本低 2-3 个数量级。三层缓存体系：精确/语义缓存（相同或相似请求直接返回历史结果，成本 ≈ 0）、Prompt Cache（厂商内建，重复输入前缀仅付标价 10%）、请求去重（幂等请求合并，消除并发重复）。对高频长前缀场景，综合缓存可节省 70-90% 输入成本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"缓存是-不花钱-的优化\">缓存是&quot;不花钱&quot;的优化</h2><p>缓存的本质是空间换时间——或更准确地说，<strong>存储成本换推理成本</strong>。对 LLM 推理而言，存储成本（内存/磁盘）比推理成本（GPU 计算）低 2-3 个数量级，使得缓存成为 ROI 最确定的优化手段之一。</p>\n<p>LLM 场景的三层缓存体系：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[请求到达] --&gt; B{精确缓存命中?}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[返回缓存结果&lt;br/&gt;成本 = 0]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| D{语义缓存命中?}&#10;    D --&gt;|是| E[返回相似结果&lt;br/&gt;成本 = 检索成本]&#10;    D --&gt;|否| F{Prompt Cache 命中?}&#10;    F --&gt;|是| G[LLM 调用&lt;br/&gt;输入成本 × 10%]&#10;    F --&gt;|否| H[完整 LLM 调用&lt;br/&gt;全价]&#10;&#10;    C --&gt; I[成本节省 100%]&#10;    E --&gt; J[成本节省 ~100%]&#10;    G --&gt; K[成本节省 70-90%]&#10;    H --&gt; L[无节省]\">graph TD\n    A[请求到达] --&gt; B{精确缓存命中?}\n    B --&gt;|是| C[返回缓存结果&lt;br/&gt;成本 = 0]\n    B --&gt;|否| D{语义缓存命中?}\n    D --&gt;|是| E[返回相似结果&lt;br/&gt;成本 = 检索成本]\n    D --&gt;|否| F{Prompt Cache 命中?}\n    F --&gt;|是| G[LLM 调用&lt;br/&gt;输入成本 × 10%]\n    F --&gt;|否| H[完整 LLM 调用&lt;br/&gt;全价]\n\n    C --&gt; I[成本节省 100%]\n    E --&gt; J[成本节省 ~100%]\n    G --&gt; K[成本节省 70-90%]\n    H --&gt; L[无节省]</pre><h2 id=\"层级一-prompt-cache-厂商内建\">层级一：Prompt Cache（厂商内建）</h2><p>Prompt Cache 是 2025-2026 年各厂商标配的成本优化功能——重复出现的输入 token 前缀仅需支付标价的 10-25%。</p>\n<h3 id=\"openai-自动缓存\">OpenAI 自动缓存</h3><p>OpenAI 的 Prompt Cache 完全自动触发，无需代码改动：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>前缀超过 1024 token 自动进入缓存</li>\n<li>缓存命中时输入 token 价格降至标价的 10%</li>\n<li>TTL 约 5-10 分钟（按调用频率动态调整）</li>\n<li>支持跨请求的共享前缀</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>最佳实践</strong>：将不变的内容（系统 Prompt、few-shot 示例、工具描述）放在消息列表的最前面，动态内容放在后面。这样不变部分的缓存命中率最大化。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"messages = [&#10;    # 固定前缀 — 高缓存命中率&#10;    {&quot;role&quot;: &quot;system&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: SYSTEM_PROMPT},      # 4000 tokens&#10;    {&quot;role&quot;: &quot;user&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: FEW_SHOT_EXAMPLES},    # 2000 tokens&#10;    # 动态后缀 — 每次不同&#10;    {&quot;role&quot;: &quot;user&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: user_query},           # 200 tokens&#10;]&#10;# 4000 + 2000 = 6000 tokens 缓存命中 → 仅付 10%&#10;# 实际输入成本 = 6000×0.1 + 200×1.0 = 800 等效 token\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">messages </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 固定前缀 — 高缓存命中率</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"role\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"system\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"content\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SYSTEM_PROMPT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 4000 tokens</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"role\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"user\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"content\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">FEW_SHOT_EXAMPLES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},    </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 2000 tokens</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 动态后缀 — 每次不同</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"role\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"user\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"content\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: user_query},           </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 200 tokens</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 4000 + 2000 = 6000 tokens 缓存命中 → 仅付 10%</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 实际输入成本 = 6000×0.1 + 200×1.0 = 800 等效 token</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"anthropic-显式缓存\">Anthropic 显式缓存</h3><p>Anthropic 的缓存需要用 <code>cache_control</code> 标记显式声明缓存断点：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"response = client.messages.create(&#10;    model=&quot;claude-sonnet-4-6&quot;,&#10;    system=[&#10;        {&#10;            &quot;type&quot;: &quot;text&quot;,&#10;            &quot;text&quot;: LONG_SYSTEM_PROMPT,&#10;            &quot;cache_control&quot;: {&quot;type&quot;: &quot;ephemeral&quot;}  # 标记缓存&#10;        }&#10;    ],&#10;    messages=[{&quot;role&quot;: &quot;user&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: query}]&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">response </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> client.messages.create(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    model</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"claude-sonnet-4-6\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    system</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"text\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"text\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">LONG_SYSTEM_PROMPT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"cache_control\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ephemeral\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 标记缓存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    messages</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[{</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"role\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"user\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"content\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: query}]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Anthropic 缓存的经济学略有不同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>费用</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>首次写入缓存</td>\n<td>标价 × 125%</td>\n<td>比不缓存还贵 25%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>后续读取缓存</td>\n<td>标价 × 10%</td>\n<td>极大折扣</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不缓存（基准）</td>\n<td>标价 × 100%</td>\n<td>每次全价</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>盈亏平衡点</strong>：第 N 次调用后缓存开始盈利：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.25</mn><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mn>0.1</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>1.0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.25 + (N-1) \\times 0.1 &lt; N \\times 1.0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.25</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6835em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.0</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>解得 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1.28</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N &gt; 1.28</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.28</span></span></span></span></span>——即<strong>第 2 次调用就开始省钱</strong>。但考虑 TTL 过期和命中率，实际盈亏平衡在 3-4 次调用。</p>\n<h3 id=\"缓存效果量化\">缓存效果量化</h3><p>一个日均 5 万次调用的 Agent 系统（8K 系统 Prompt + 工具描述）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>日输入 token 成本（Sonnet $3/M）</th>\n<th>节省</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>无缓存</td>\n<td>5万 × 8000 × <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3/M =</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span></span></span></span>1,200</td>\n<td>基线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>80% 缓存命中</td>\n<td>1万 × 8000 × <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mtext>万</mtext><mo>×</mo><mn>8000</mn><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3/M + 4万 × 8000 ×</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">万</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8000</span><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span></span>0.3/M = $336</td>\n<td>72%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>95% 缓存命中</td>\n<td>0.25万 × 8000 × <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4.75</mn><mtext>万</mtext><mo>×</mo><mn>8000</mn><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3/M + 4.75万 × 8000 ×</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4.75</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">万</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8000</span><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span></span>0.3/M = $174</td>\n<td>86%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"层级二-语义缓存\">层级二：语义缓存</h2><p>语义缓存解决的问题：不同措辞但相同意图的请求，不需要每次都重新调用 LLM。</p>\n<h3 id=\"工作原理\">工作原理</h3><ol>\n<li>将用户请求编码为向量（embedding）</li>\n<li>在缓存中搜索余弦相似度 &gt; 阈值的历史请求</li>\n<li>命中则直接返回历史响应</li>\n<li>未命中则正常调用 LLM，将结果存入缓存</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import numpy as np&#10;from openai import OpenAI&#10;&#10;SIMILARITY_THRESHOLD = 0.95  # 高阈值保证准确性&#10;CACHE_TTL_SECONDS = 3600     # 1 小时过期&#10;&#10;class SemanticCache:&#10;    def __init__(self):&#10;        self.embeddings = []   # 向量存储&#10;        self.responses = []    # 对应响应&#10;        self.timestamps = []   # 时间戳&#10;&#10;    def get(self, query: str) -&gt; str | None:&#10;        query_vec = get_embedding(query)&#10;&#10;        for i, cached_vec in enumerate(self.embeddings):&#10;            if self._is_expired(i):&#10;                continue&#10;            similarity = np.dot(query_vec, cached_vec)&#10;            if similarity &gt;= SIMILARITY_THRESHOLD:&#10;                return self.responses[i]&#10;&#10;        return None  # 未命中&#10;&#10;    def put(self, query: str, response: str):&#10;        self.embeddings.append(get_embedding(query))&#10;        self.responses.append(response)&#10;        self.timestamps.append(time.time())\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> openai </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OpenAI</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SIMILARITY_THRESHOLD</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.95</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 高阈值保证准确性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">CACHE_TTL_SECONDS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3600</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">     # 1 小时过期</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SemanticCache</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.embeddings </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 向量存储</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.responses </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []    </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 对应响应</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.timestamps </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 时间戳</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, query: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        query_vec </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> get_embedding(query)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i, cached_vec </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> enumerate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.embeddings):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">._is_expired(i):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                continue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            similarity </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.dot(query_vec, cached_vec)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> similarity </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SIMILARITY_THRESHOLD</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.responses[i]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 未命中</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> put</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, query: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, response: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.embeddings.append(get_embedding(query))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.responses.append(response)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.timestamps.append(time.time())</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"适用场景与命中率\">适用场景与命中率</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>典型命中率</th>\n<th>适用性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>FAQ / 客服问答</td>\n<td>40-60%</td>\n<td>极佳——高重复率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文档摘要</td>\n<td>20-40%</td>\n<td>好——同文档多次被问</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代码生成</td>\n<td>5-15%</td>\n<td>一般——每次需求差异大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>创意写作</td>\n<td>&lt;5%</td>\n<td>差——几乎无重复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据分析查询</td>\n<td>15-30%</td>\n<td>中——相似查询模式</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"语义缓存的风险与缓解\">语义缓存的风险与缓解</h3><p><strong>风险一：过期答案</strong></p>\n<p>缓存的响应可能基于过时信息。缓解：设置合理的 TTL，对时效性强的场景（如&quot;今天的天气&quot;）禁用缓存。</p>\n<p><strong>风险二：相似但不同的请求</strong></p>\n<p>相似度 0.95 的两个请求可能需要不同回答（如&quot;Python 排序&quot;vs&quot;Java 排序&quot;）。缓解：将模型/任务类型作为缓存键的一部分，不仅看语义相似度。</p>\n<p><strong>风险三：缓存污染</strong></p>\n<p>低质量响应被缓存后反复返回。缓解：只缓存经过质量验证的响应，或对缓存响应做用户反馈追踪。</p>\n<h2 id=\"层级三-请求去重\">层级三：请求去重</h2><h3 id=\"幂等请求合并\">幂等请求合并</h3><p>在高并发场景下，同一秒内可能有多个相同请求到达。请求去重在网关层合并这些重复调用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const inflightRequests = new Map&lt;string, Promise&lt;Response&gt;&gt;();&#10;&#10;async function deduplicatedCall(key: string, callFn: () =&gt; Promise&lt;Response&gt;) {&#10;  if (inflightRequests.has(key)) {&#10;    return inflightRequests.get(key)!; // 复用进行中的请求&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  const promise = callFn();&#10;  inflightRequests.set(key, promise);&#10;&#10;  try {&#10;    return await promise;&#10;  } finally {&#10;    inflightRequests.delete(key);&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> inflightRequests</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Response</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> deduplicatedCall</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">callFn</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Response</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (inflightRequests.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">has</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inflightRequests.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 复用进行中的请求</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> promise</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> callFn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  inflightRequests.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key, promise);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> promise;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">finally</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    inflightRequests.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">delete</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"批量内去重\">批量内去重</h3><p>批处理场景中，一批请求内可能存在重复项。去重后再发送：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>去重率</th>\n<th>方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>产品描述生成（同 SKU 多次触发）</td>\n<td>20-40%</td>\n<td>精确 key 匹配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用户意图分类（相同消息重发）</td>\n<td>10-20%</td>\n<td>精确 + 规范化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RAG 答案生成（相同文档段落）</td>\n<td>15-30%</td>\n<td>content hash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"缓存架构设计\">缓存架构设计</h2><h3 id=\"缓存键设计\">缓存键设计</h3><p>有效的缓存键需要平衡命中率和准确性：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface CacheKey {&#10;  model: string; // 不同模型输出不同&#10;  system_prompt_hash: string; // 系统 Prompt 变更时失效&#10;  user_content: string; // 用户输入&#10;  temperature: number; // 不同温度输出不同&#10;  response_format?: string; // 格式要求影响输出&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CacheKey</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  model</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 不同模型输出不同</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  system_prompt_hash</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 系统 Prompt 变更时失效</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  user_content</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 用户输入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  temperature</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 不同温度输出不同</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  response_format</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 格式要求影响输出</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"缓存层级组合\">缓存层级组合</h3><p>生产系统通常组合多层缓存，按优先级查询：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>存储</th>\n<th>TTL</th>\n<th>命中率</th>\n<th>成本节省</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>L1 请求去重</td>\n<td>进程内存</td>\n<td>请求进行中</td>\n<td>5-10%</td>\n<td>100%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L2 精确缓存</td>\n<td>Redis</td>\n<td>1-24h</td>\n<td>10-30%</td>\n<td>100%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L3 语义缓存</td>\n<td>Vector DB</td>\n<td>1-72h</td>\n<td>20-40%</td>\n<td>~100%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L4 Prompt Cache</td>\n<td>厂商内建</td>\n<td>5min-1h</td>\n<td>60-90%</td>\n<td>70-90%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"综合收益估算\">综合收益估算</h3><p>一个月 50 万次调用的系统（Sonnet <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3/M input,</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span></span></span>15/M output，平均 6000 input + 500 output tokens）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>缓存层</th>\n<th>命中率</th>\n<th>月节省金额</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>精确缓存</td>\n<td>15%</td>\n<td>$1,580</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语义缓存</td>\n<td>额外 10%</td>\n<td>$1,053</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Prompt Cache</td>\n<td>对剩余请求 80% 命中</td>\n<td>$5,400</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>总计</strong></td>\n<td></td>\n<td><strong>$8,033/月（约 76%）</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"缓存策略选择决策树\">缓存策略选择决策树</h2><p>选择缓存策略的核心考量：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>请求重复率高吗？</strong>（&gt;20%）→ 优先精确缓存 + 语义缓存</li>\n<li><strong>系统 Prompt 长吗？</strong>（&gt;2000 tokens）→ 优先 Prompt Cache</li>\n<li><strong>输出对时效性敏感吗？</strong> → 缩短 TTL 或跳过缓存</li>\n<li><strong>输出需要个性化吗？</strong> → 缓存键需包含用户上下文</li>\n<li><strong>调用频率高吗？</strong>（&gt;1000/h）→ Prompt Cache 命中率天然高</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>缓存策略的核心决策：高重复率场景优先精确缓存和语义缓存（FAQ、文档问答）；长系统 Prompt 场景必开 Prompt Cache（零代码改动或极少改动即可获得 70-90% 输入折扣）；高并发场景加请求去重。三层缓存互补而非互斥——组合使用可实现 76% 以上的总成本节省。注意缓存的风险管理：TTL 设置、过期答案、缓存污染都需要持续监控。</p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p>相关文档：<a href=\"prompt-compression\">Prompt 压缩与 Token 工程</a> 缓存之外的输入/输出 token 削减技术</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"缓存与去重策略","id":"缓存与去重策略"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"缓存是\"不花钱\"的优化","id":"缓存是-不花钱-的优化"},{"level":2,"text":"层级一：Prompt Cache（厂商内建）","id":"层级一-prompt-cache-厂商内建"},{"level":3,"text":"OpenAI 自动缓存","id":"openai-自动缓存"},{"level":3,"text":"Anthropic 显式缓存","id":"anthropic-显式缓存"},{"level":3,"text":"缓存效果量化","id":"缓存效果量化"},{"level":2,"text":"层级二：语义缓存","id":"层级二-语义缓存"},{"level":3,"text":"工作原理","id":"工作原理"},{"level":3,"text":"适用场景与命中率","id":"适用场景与命中率"},{"level":3,"text":"语义缓存的风险与缓解","id":"语义缓存的风险与缓解"},{"level":2,"text":"层级三：请求去重","id":"层级三-请求去重"},{"level":3,"text":"幂等请求合并","id":"幂等请求合并"},{"level":3,"text":"批量内去重","id":"批量内去重"},{"level":2,"text":"缓存架构设计","id":"缓存架构设计"},{"level":3,"text":"缓存键设计","id":"缓存键设计"},{"level":3,"text":"缓存层级组合","id":"缓存层级组合"},{"level":3,"text":"综合收益估算","id":"综合收益估算"},{"level":2,"text":"缓存策略选择决策树","id":"缓存策略选择决策树"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"模型路由与级联","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-cost-token-optimization/optimization/model-routing-cascading"},"next":{"title":"批处理与异步模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-cost-token-optimization/infrastructure/batch-async-patterns"}}